# Status board canvas (Cursor main agent)

Visual of the **status board**. Lanes, confirm, 24h backlog, Job titles,
and truth source live in:

`~/.cursor/rules/status-board.mdc`

Do not invent a second list.

## Canvas path

`~/.cursor/projects/<workspace-slug>/canvases/active-workers-board.canvas.tsx`

Example for `sume-com`:
`/Users/huhchaewon/.cursor/projects/Users-huhchaewon-sume-sume-com/canvases/active-workers-board.canvas.tsx`

Create if missing (read `~/.cursor/skills-cursor/canvas/SKILL.md` first).
Link that absolute `.canvas.tsx` path when you mention the board.

## When to refresh (same turn)

1. Launch / completion / abort / steer / kill / resume
2. A Job **enters 스테이징** or ages into **백로그** (≥24h, no confirm)
3. Chase **confirms** (resolve → `확인됨`)
4. User asks board / worker status

Reconcile → rewrite canvas → chat reprint (`end-of-turn-worker-brief.mdc`).

Snapshot timestamp in the header. Visible copy follows Chase’s language.
Identifiers stay English.

## Non-goals

- Not a substitute for completion-notification monitoring
- Codex / Claude Code as main agent: ignore (Cursor-only)
